# The ACPI launch regression's stand-in for acpi.svc (tests/headless,
# gpio-launch): the validated com.cubit.acpi identity, approved for
# acpi-hardware and acpi-firmware-data (devmgr's "hardware-data" endpoint,
# over which the GPIO bootstrap admission is asked). No policy widening.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.acpi"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    (Request.Firmware_Snapshot "tables")
    (Request.ACPI_Hardware "hardware")
    (service "device-manager" "device-manager")])
